addOft.t.sol
├── when caller does not have the relevant role
│  └── it should revert with AccessManagedUnauthorized
└── when caller has the relevant role
   ├── when the provided OFT address is zero
   │  └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
   └── when the provided OFT address is not zero
      ├── given the provided OFT is already registered
      │  └── it should revert with OftAlreadyRegistered
      └── given the provided OFT is not registered
         ├── it should mark the provided OFT as registered
         └── it should emit an OftAdded event
